                "text": "Let\u2019s be clear: undocumented immigrants aren't covered by the ACA or Medicaid\u2014period.\n\nWe want to protect American\u2019s healthcare after Republicans voted to strip over 10 million people of their healthcare in the Big, Ugly Bill. https://t.co/7efY0TnT8a",
