                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Farm workers that depend on the ACA and are now left wondering if they'll be able to afford health insurance.\n\nMeanwhile, farm loan processing has halted and disaster assistance payments are delayed \u2014 all while farmers are already struggling with tariffs. They can't afford this chaos.",
