                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nearly 1.5 million North Carolinians are at risk of higher healthcare costs or may lose their healthcare entirely.\n\nWhile the House hasn't been in session since September 19, our constituents are facing a healthcare crisis. This isn't about politics, this is about saving lives.",
