                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I don't agree with @RepMTG often, but moms like her and I know that the cost of healthcare\u2014and just about everything\u2014is far too high.\n\nThe American people can't afford this Administration, and that's why Democrats are fighting back. https://t.co/6HJvNy5HzO",
