                "quoted_status_profile_username": "LeaderJohnThune",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The American people are being held hostage. In my state, a 45-year-old making $62,000 will see their average health insurance costs rise by over $1,500.\n\nFamilies don\u2019t need promises about holding certain votes, they need affordable healthcare.",
