                "quoted_status_profile_username": "axios",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump won't help our struggling farmers, federal workers that are being furloughed, or working families who are worried about their healthcare costs.\n\nInstead, he's sending $20 billion to Argentina.\n\nHurting working families to bail out your friends isn't putting America first.",
