                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our government is shut down, healthcare costs are out of control, and inflation hit 3% for the first time since January.\n\nBut destroying the White House to make a ballroom is the 'main priority' for Trump and the GOP.",
