                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 2026, a family of four in Chapel Hill could face a $4,000 increase to their health care costs compared to 2025.\n\nThat's why @HouseDemocrats are fighting to extend the Obamacare tax credits.\n\nTo preview 2026 ACA insurance premiums, visit https://t.co/ccM673Xdvp. (1/2) https://t.co/qsDqAJwC31",
