                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No one in America should see their healthcare costs rise by $25,000, but that's what families are facing here in North Carolina.\n\nStill, House Republicans won't come to work to find a long-term solution to their health care crisis. https://t.co/liwCDjB6IB",
