                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump is now leveraging SNAP in his effort to pass a short-term budget bill that ignores rising healthcare costs.\n\nThe American people deserve better.\n\n@HouseDemocrats are demanding that Trump pay November SNAP benefits in full TODAY.\n\nhttps://t.co/huzvPgA2OC",
